      "profit": "Gross profit on direct costs (trade labour, materials, commission and other direct lines), ex GST. No overhead share. Trade charges and recorded employer-super obligations are separate cost events. Only events marked actual count; missing on-cost evidence does not establish zero or cost-close.",
      "quoted_ex": "What was quoted: the value of a sent or accepted quote, ex GST. Null when no quote was sent. Never the live price. quoted_source names the quote it came from.",
