      "actual_cost_ex": "Actual cost from the job's own lines only: trade charges, supplier bills and materials facts linked to the job (cost_basis is always line_level; line_level_cost_ex is the same figure). Never a Xero Project total.",
      "xero_project_expenses_ex": "Expenses on record against the job's Xero Project. Evidence only, not the job's full cost: trade labour may sit outside it. Never part of actual cost, profit, margin or any company, work-type or month total. A Xero Project counts only when its name carries the job's own job number; one linked by contact only gives no figure and the job is flagged xero_project_linked_by_contact_only.",
      "xero_project_exceeds_line_costs": "The Xero Project has more expenses on record than the costs linked to the job, so the job's full cost is unknown. Profit and margin are null until those expenses are linked to the job.",
