      "invoice_emailed_count": "Invoice emailed, no bill matched to this order: the supplier emailed an invoice for the order, and no bill is linked to the order yet. The bill may already be on the job without a link to the order, so check before chasing it. Money owed or paid, never nothing owed. invoice_emailed_ex is the amount of the priced ones; it is in neither committed_open_ex nor actual cost.",
